    "descriptionLong": "Meet Endo, the super comfortable health band designed to support your lifestyle every moment of the day. Stay active and stay healthy while Endo monitors your health 24/7, giving you valuable insights into your daily performance and wellbeing. Its ultra-thin and lightweight design ensures maximum comfort, complemented by a soft fabric armband that feels great on the skin, making it perfect to wear both day and night. With a 1ATM waterproof rating, Endo is suitable for swimming and other water activities, so nothing holds you back. Track up to 100 different sports and stay on top of your progress, no matter your activity. With a battery life of up to 7 days, Endo keeps going as long as you do, while monitoring sleep, stress levels, heart rate, and more. All your data is clearly displayed in the free-to-use health app, helping you stay informed, motivated, and in control. Item and accessories are PVC free and packed in FSC packaging without plastic.",
